<!-- About -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-visual">
      <span class="photo-note">Your photo here</span>
      <div class="about-visual-text">
        <div class="big">Betty</div>
        <p>Detroit &amp; Portage, Michigan</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>The hands behind the name.</h2>
      <p>Betty built Betty Bella Braids on one belief: braids should feel as good as they look. No pulling, no rushing, no shortcuts. Just clean parts, gentle hands, and styles that last.</p>
      <p>As a <strong>human hair specialist</strong>, Betty works with real human hair to create designer braids with movement and shine that synthetic hair cannot match. Her boho knotless styles have made her one of Michigan's most watched braiders, with <strong>180,000 followers</strong> on Instagram following every style she drops.</p>
      <p>Betty welcomes clients at her physical shop in Kalamazoo, serving Detroit and Portage, and shares tutorials and behind the scenes looks on her YouTube channel. When you sit in her chair, you get the same care she shows on camera, every single time.</p>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/betty_bella_braids/" class="btn btn-rose" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow @betty_bella_braids →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

